text: ['Play with the top card of your library revealed.\\nAs long as the top card of your library is black, Vampire Nocturnus and other Vampire creatures you control get +2/+1 and have flying.', 'Primordial Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, double the number of +1/+1 counters on Primordial Hydra.\\nPrimordial Hydra has trample as long as it has ten or more +1/+1 counters on it.', "Serra Avatar's power and toughness are each equal to your life total.\\nWhen Serra Avatar is put into a graveyard from anywhere, shuffle it into its owner's library."]
flavor: ['"Your life will set with the sun."']
